---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /referrals/
title: Make a referral
seo_title: NDIS Referrals | Every Human Support Services
seo_description: Support coordinators, plan managers and LACs can refer participants to Every Human Support Services in Wollongong, Ulladulla, Logan and the Gold Coast in a couple of minutes.
---
{%- from "partials/icons.njk" import icon -%}
<section class="page-hd">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>Make a referral</h1>
    <p class="lead">For support coordinators, plan managers, LACs, health professionals and families. It takes a couple of minutes, and we'll be in touch within one business day.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="sec">
  <div class="wrap contact-in">
    <div class="contact-side">
      <h2 class="h-sm">What happens next</h2>
      <ol class="mini-steps">
        <li>We confirm we've received your referral.</li>
        <li>We contact the participant or their nominee to arrange a meet and greet.</li>
        <li>We send a service agreement and match a support team.</li>
        <li>We keep you updated as supports begin.</li>
      </ol>
      <div class="side-photo">{% img photos.referrals.image, photos.referrals.alt, "(max-width: 960px) 92vw, 420px" %}</div>
      <p class="form-note">Registered NDIS provider. We accept agency, plan and self-managed participants, plus aged care clients through brokerage and private clients.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="form embed-card">
      <h2>Referral form</h2>
      <p class="form-note embed-note">Your referral goes straight into our secure client system.</p>
      <div class="embed-frame">
        {#- Astalty referral form. Paste a new code here if Astalty ever changes it. -#}
        <script type="text/javascript" src="{{ site.referral_form_script }}"></script>
        <noscript><p>Our referral form needs JavaScript. Please email <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a> instead.</p></noscript>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
